    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3261652536",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"0.5,0.2,1\">World Builder Mod</> \\n\\nConsume this item to equip Admin Tools.<#RN#>The tool contain different modes to edit your world.<#RN#>Require GCM and Admin to use.<#RN#><#RN#>Warning : Do not give this to players if you don't want them to be able to modify your world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"0.5,0.2,1\">世界建造者模组</> \\n\\n使用该物品即可装备管理员工具.<#RN#>该工具包含多种模式，可用来编辑游戏世界.<#RN#>需要开启管理员权限与 GCM 权限才能使用.<#RN#><#RN#>警告：若不希望普通玩家修改你的世界，请勿将此物品交给他们","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
